rmuring Stave" publicationId="79c0cbf6-2602-pub1" hidden="false"><characteristics><characteristic typeId="6fa97fa8-ea74-4a27-a0fb-bc4e5f367464" name="Range">-</characteristic><characteristic typeId="a6383362-5aa8-4ff0-b1d0-00e059fc9d45" name="Strength">User</characteristic><characteristic typeId="6abee736-f8d3-498e-97ac-a5c68445609f" name="AP">-</characteristic><characteristic typeId="077c342f-d7b9-45c6-b8af-88e97cafd3a2" name="Type">Melee, Force, Haywire, Master-crafted, Ancestral Guidance</characteristic></characteristics></profile><profile typeId="d5f97c0b-9fc9-478d-aa34-a7c414d3ea48" typeName="Weapon" id="271ccff6-9b38-54e5-8305-f404dac503ca" name="Vôlumm's Master Artifice" publicationId="79c0cbf6-2602-pub1" hidden="false"><characteristics><characteristic typeId="6fa97fa8-ea74-4a27-a0fb-bc4e5f367464" name="Range">Template</characteristic><characteristic typeId="a6383362-5aa8-4ff0-b1d0-00e059fc9d45" name="Strength">*</characteristic><characteristic typeId="6abee736-f8d3-498e-97ac-a5c68445609f" name="AP">2</characteristic><characteristic typeId="077c342f-d7b9-45c6-b8af-88e97cafd3a2" name="Type">Assault, Graviton, Concussive</characteristic></characteristics></profile><profile typeId="72c5eafc-75bf-4ed9-b425-78009f1efe82" typeName="Wargear Item" id="b98e5974-bfbc-5a2d-ab96-e70a24c90497" name="Comms Array" publicationId="79c0cbf6-2602-pub1" hidden="false"><characteristics><characteristic typeId="21befb24-fc85-4f52-a745-64b2e48f8228" name="Description">A unit with a model that is equipped with a Comms Array may use the leadership characteristic of the Warlord as if he was joined to the unit.</characteristic></characteristics></profile><profile typeId="72c5eafc-75bf-4ed9-b425-78009f1efe82" typeName="Wargear Item" id="83854624-7a24-5e19-9243-9d47ee972246" name="Exo-Armour" publicationId="79c0cbf6-2602-pub1" hidden="false"><characteristics><characteristic typeId="21befb24-fc85-4f52-a745-64b2e48f8228" name="Description">A model wearing Exo-Armour has a save characteristic of a 3+ and improves their toughness by one. In addition, models wearing Exo-Armour gain the Bulky and Relentless special rules, but cannot Run or make sweeping advances.</characteristic></characteristics></profile><profile typeId="72c5eafc-75bf-4ed9-b425-78009f1efe82" typeName="Wargear Item" id="d7f57631-b089-5dbe-8968-860474a4661e" name="Kognitâar Mantle" publicationId="79c0cbf6-2602-pub1" hidden="false"><characteristics><characteristic typeId="21befb24-fc85-4f52-a745-64b2e48f8228" name="Description">At the start of each turn that a model equipped with a Kognitâar Mantle is on the battlefield, that model may take a leadership test. If passed, select from one of the following special rules to grant to a friendly unit until the start of your next turn: Counter Attack, Tank Hunter, Split Fire. If the Leadership test is failed, the model equipped with a Kognitâar Mantle and their unit Go to Ground as they await for the computational overload to dissipate.</characteristic></characteristics></profile><profile typeId="72c5eafc-75bf-4ed9-b425-78009f1efe82" typeName="Wargear Item" id="e8f3d20b-fb78-52aa-b94b-92e2b661a3e4" name="Mass Driver Accelerators" publicationId="79c0cbf6-2602-pub1" hidden="false"><characteristics><characteristic typeId="21befb24-fc85-4f52-a745-64b2e48f8228" name="Description">A model equipped with Mass Driver Accelerators gain the Move Through Cover and Hammer of Wrath special rules.</characteristic></characteristics></profile><profile typeId="72c5eafc-75bf-4ed9-b425-78009f1efe82" typeName="Wargear Item" id="62065b65-2230-5fee-b423-ba94038e2852" name="Medipack" publicationId="79c0cbf6-2602-pub1" hidden="false"><characteristics><characteristic typeId="21befb24-fc85-4f52-a745-64b2e48f8228" name="Description">A unit containing a model equipped with a Medipack gains the Feel No Pain 6+ special rule.</characteristic></characteristics></profile><profile typeId="72c5eafc-75bf-4ed9-b425-78009f1efe82" typeName="Wargear Item" id="d9d3ab38-c3cb-5e66-99ca-01df91faa8a4" name="Pan Spectral Scanner" publicationId="79c0cbf6-2602-pub1" hidden="false"><characteristics><characteristic typeId="21befb24-fc85-4f52-a745-64b2e48f8228" name="Description">Enemy units worsen their cover save by one when making Saving Throws against shooting attacks originating from a unit equipped with a Pan Spectral Scanner.</characteristic></characteristics></profile><profile typeId="72c5eafc-75bf-4ed9-b425-78009f1efe82" typeName="Wargear Item" id="91044ae1-be81-51a6-98e2-5078d852745c" name="Preymark Crest" publicationId="79c0cbf6-2602-pub1" hidden="false"><characteristics><characteristic typeId="21befb24-fc85-4f52-a745-64b2e48f8228" name="Description">A unit containing a model equipped with a Preymark Crest gains the Precision Shots and Precision Strikes special rules.</characteristic></characteristics></profile><profile typeId="72c5eafc-75bf-4ed9-b425-78009f1efe82" typeName="Wargear Item" id="831b7b88-cf18-50c4-bf4a-f84af4673793" name="RAM Shield" publicationId="79c0cbf6-2602-pub1" hidden="false"><characteristics><characteristic typeId="21befb24-fc85-4f52-a745-64b2e48f8228" name="Description">A model equipped with a RAM Shield improves their Armour Save characteristic by one to a maximum of a 2+. For every wound saved by the bearer in combat, inflict an automatic S4 AP- Hit onto the enemy unit that made the Attack.</characteristic></characteristics></profile><profile typeId="72c5eafc-75bf-4ed9-b425-78009f1efe82" typeName="Wargear Item" id="dffabddb-319c-594d-a991-2dc5c3672110" name="Rampart Crest" publicationId="79c0cbf6-2602-pub1" hidden="false"><characteristics><characteristic typeId="21befb24-fc85-4f52-a745-64b2e48f8228" name="Description">A model equipped with a Rampart Crest possess a 5+ invulnerable save. Additionally, enemies who shoot at a unit containing a model with a Rampart Crest worsen the AP of their ranged weapon profiles by 1 when resolving that shooting attack. (A weapon with AP3 turns into AP4, etc.)</characteristic></characteristics></profile><profile typeId="72c5eafc-75bf-4ed9-b425-78009f1efe82" typeName="Wargear Item" id="0013a225-63b7-53e3-aacb-14bc0bdf5d30" name="Teleport Crest" publicationId="79c0cbf6-2602-pub1" hidden="false"><characteristics><characteristic typeId="21befb24-fc85-4f52-a745-64b2e48f8228" name="Description">A model equipped with a Teleport Crest confers the Deep Strike special rule to the bearer's unit. When a friendly unit attempts to teleport onto the battlefield via Deep Strike within 6" of a model equipped with a Teleport Crest, that unit does not scatter; however, the bearer must have been already on the battlefield at the start of the turn to use this effect.</characteristic></characteristics></profile><profile typeId="72c5eafc-75bf-4ed9-b425-78009f1efe82" typeName="Wargear Item" id="290c24d4-4579-51be-8281-bb323b7a9425" name="Ward Crest" publicationId="79c0cbf6-2602-pub1" hidden="false"><characteristics><characteristic typeId="21befb24-fc85-4f52-a745-64b2e48f8228" name="Description">A model equipped with a Ward Crest has a 4+ Invulnerable save.</characteristic></characteristics></profile><profile typeId="72c5eafc-75bf-4ed9-b425-78009f1efe82" typeName="Wargear Item" id="29655d3a-559a-5392-bc7c-4c04d86ad604" name="Weavefield Crest" publicationId="79c0cbf6-2602-pub1" hidden="false"><characteristics><characteristic typeId="21befb24-fc85-4f52-a745-64b2e48f8228" name="Description">A unit containing a model equipped with a Weavefield Crest gains a 6+ Invulnerable save.</characteristic></characteristics></profile><profile typeId="72c5eafc-75bf-4ed9-b425-78009f1efe82" typeName="Wargear Item" id="7be6582a-753c-5fa1-b515-622ce234be2a" name="RAIDR Rocket Pack (Jump Pack)" publicationId="79c0cbf6-2602-pub1" hidden="false"><characteristics><characteristic typeId="21befb24-fc85-4f52-a745-64b2e48f8228" name="Description">The model has a Jump Pack (Unit Type becomes Jump Infantry).</characteristic></characteristics></profile><profile typeId="72c5eafc-75bf-4ed9-b425-78009f1efe82" typeName="Wargear Item" id="4c82ad96-7bb3-57ad-86d2-5452cb407abb" name="Magna-Coil Bike (Jetbike)" publicationId="79c0cbf6-2602-pub1" hidden="false"><characteristics><characteristic typeId="21befb24-fc85-4f52-a745-64b2e48f8228" name="Description">The model rides a Magna-Coil Bike (Unit Type becomes Jetbike) equipped with an Autocannon.</characteristic></characteristics></profile><profile typeId="72c5eafc-75bf-4ed9-b425-78009f1efe82" typeName="Wargear Item" id="9ffda6d9-ab7b-5e22-8509-12ed78ed8cbf" name="Aktôl's Fortress" publicationId="79c0cbf6-2602-pub1" hidden="false"><characteristics><characteristic typeId="21befb24-fc85-4f52-a745-64b2e48f8228" name="Description">In the first round of an assault, enemy units engaged with the bearer strike at initiative 1.</characteristic></characteristics></profile><profile typeId="72c5eafc-75bf-4ed9-b425-78009f1efe82" typeName="Wargear Item" id="c8aec89f-aed4-5c7c-af3a-6cc0c5747870" name="Ancestral Crest" publicationId="79c0cbf6-2602-pub1" hidden="false"><characteristics><characteristic typeId="21befb24-fc85-4f52-a745-64b2e48f8228" name="Description">This relic may only be purchased by your Warlord. At the start of your turn, you may choose to replace your current warlord trait by randomly generating a new warlord trait from any table available to your warlord.</characteristic></characteristics></profile><profile typeId="72c5eafc-75bf-4ed9-b425-78009f1efe82" typeName="Wargear Item" id="a855e861-738b-5494-b7bf-81a14151e481" name="Wayfarer's Grace" publicationId="79c0cbf6-2602-pub1" hidden="false"><characteristics><characteristic typeId="21befb24-fc85-4f52-a745-64b2e48f8228" name="Description">The bearer gains the Feel No Pain (4+) special rule.</characteristic></characteristics></profile><profile typeId="72c5eafc-75bf-4ed9-b425-78009f1efe82" typeName="Wargear Item" id="0c3c7c21-8bc4-5731-ac45-3180e53048c9" name="The Grey Crest" publicationId="79c0cbf6-2602-pub1" hidden="false"><characteristics><characteristic typeId="21befb24-fc85-4f52-a745-64b2e48f8228" name="Description">The bearer counts as having Defensive Grenades and confers the Stealth special rule to them and their unit.</characteristic></characteristics></profile><profile typeId="72c5eafc-75bf-4ed9-b425-78009f1efe82" typeName="Wargear Item" id="e987dcf8-325e-50e0-9d40-0f5a8bd03da8" name="Wârpestryk" publicationId="79c0cbf6-2602-pub1" hidden="false"><characteristics><characteristic typeId="21befb24-fc85-4f52-a745-64b2e48f8228" name="Description">Once per game at the start of your movement phase, if the bearer and their unit is unengaged, you may pick up and redeploy the bearer's unit anywhere on the battlefield as if arriving from Deep Strike. Roll to scatter as normal.</characteristic></characteristics></profile><profile typeId="72c5eafc-75bf-4ed9-b425-78009f1efe82" typeName="Wargear Item" id="f21deab2-87f3-5885-9e33-19482240ee3b" name="Thyrikite Plate" publicationId="79c0cbf6-2602-pub1" hidden="false"><characteristics><characteristic typeId="21befb24-fc85-4f52-a745-64b2e48f8228" name="Description">Before an enemy rolls To Wound against the bearer, the Toughness characteristic of the bearer is treated as being one higher for every Hit inflicted.</characteristic></characteristics></profile><profile typeId="72c5eafc-75bf-4ed9-b425-78009f1efe82" typeName="Wargear Item" id="2a9c6d4f-2f4f-56da-9d75-ca92c43b3dd7" name="Ymmâ's Shield" publicationId="79c0cbf6-2602-pub1" hidden="false"><characteristics><characteristic typeId="21befb24-fc85-4f52-a745-64b2e48f8228" name="Description">The bearer may re-roll Saving Throws of 1.</characteristic></characteristics></profile><profile typeId="72c5eafc-75bf-4ed9-b425-78009f1efe82" typeName="Wargear Item" id="2accb7d1-2814-5ed1-87d4-a1b8dc7fd8f1" name="Armour of Ugnÿr (Wargear)" publicationId="79c0cbf6-2602-pub1" hidden="false"><characteristics><characteristic typeId="21befb24-fc85-4f52-a745-64b2e48f8228" name="Description">The wearer is immune to the effects of the Fleshbane and Poisoned special rules. If as a result the attack has no strength value, it wounds on a To Wound roll of a 6.</characteristic></characteristics></profile><profile typeId="2d6001b0-980e-46d2-bcc2-a9fc60109afd" typeName="Unit" id="6b41a513-8032-5a9d-a9b6-9c99e0fdf493" name="Kâhl" publicationId="79c0cbf6-2602-pub1" hidden="false"><characteristics><characteristic typeId="c2b4b061-a0fd-499d-8a3d-6ee52587cbd5" name="Unit Type">Infantry (Character)</characteristic><characteristic typeId="5ee4ff0b-b244-4670-9d05-91d10f80c32e" name="WS">5</characteristic><characteristic typeId="f6f92f00-8bb1-4afa-8ccb-46310b7dd5e5" name="BS">5</characteristic><characteristic typeId="da036dbb-32c2-430a-9dd5-aa74e0c4f74b" name="S">4</characteristic><characteristic typeId="3f9ed75c-36cd-4169-9cef-48391bb55cfd" name="T">4</characteristic><characteristic typeId="17ee558f-3014-4bd2-afc1-b474d8d2b7a8" name="W">3</characteristic><characteristic typeId="a558b3ef-04d0-440e-a312-bac3255bf592" name="I">3</characteristic><characteristic typeId="5dff3e7c-e024-4030-a71d-03195ec06ea7" name="A">3</characteristic><characteristic typeId="4a42059d-12cd-4c1f-a4c7-bb569d13eeea" name="Ld">10</characteristic><characteristic typeId="b215fe72-dbce-4ad6-89ec-c4bb3962c39d" name="Save">3+</characteristic></characteristics></profile><profile typeId="2d6001b0-980e-46d2-bcc2-a9fc60109afd" typeName="Unit" id="9bb53650-a0d1-5e1c-b32f-c68a6ac81f6c" name="Einhyr Champion" publicationId="79c0cbf6-2602-pub1" hidden="false"><characteristics><characteristic typeId="c2b4b061-a0fd-499d-8a3d-6ee52587cbd5" name="Unit Type">Infantry (Character)</characteristic><characteristic typeId="5ee4ff0b-b244-4670-9d05-91d10f80c32e" name="WS">6</characteristic><characteristic typeId="f6f92f00-8bb1-4afa-8ccb-46310b7dd5e5" name="BS">4</characteristic><characteristic typeId="da036dbb-32c2-430a-9dd5-aa74e0c4f74b" name="S">4</characteristic><characteristic typeId="3f9ed75c-36cd-4169-9cef-48391bb55cfd" name="T">5</characteristic><characteristic typeId="17ee558f-3014-4bd2-af